data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:53950&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364402560000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17RakQiW3nVQa_VYAxJzwI\">http://127.0.0.1:53950</a></div><div>Loading required package: bitops</div><div>Error in function (type, msg, asError = TRUE)  : </div><div>  SSL: certificate subject name () does not match target host name &#39;<a href=\"http://ec2-xx-xxx-xxx-xx.compute-1.amazonaws.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ec2-xx-xxx-xxx-xx.compute-1.amazonaws.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364402560000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1h_GFSfnPGCdWGLV68Pwxr\">ec2-xx-xxx-xxx-xx.compute-1.amazonaws.com</a>&#39;</div></div></code></div><br></div><div>How can I bypass this issue?</div><div>Thank you,</div><div>Kirill.</div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
